{
  "name": "18 · No-Show Stopper (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Ops)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 18 · No-Show Killer\nAppointment se 1 din pehle + 2 ghante pehle WhatsApp reminder (1 = confirm, 2 = cancel). Cancel → slot free → waitlist ke pehle customer ko offer.\n\n**Setup (15 min)**\n1. WhatsApp nodes: **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential + your **Phone Number ID** (replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID).\n2. Google Calendar OAuth2 credential. Put `phone: 91XXXXXXXXXX` in each appointment's description.\n3. Google Sheets: **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential, paste your sheet URL in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Waitlist**: Name, Phone, Status.\n4. AI model: **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "73327b79-531e-4033-9c73-eac0408b5b70",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        -480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e9cf5df6-d3d8-4207-8d92-d8c5413e73e3",
      "name": "Every hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "primary"
        },
        "returnAll": true,
        "timeMin": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
        "timeMax": "={{ $now.plus({ hours: 26 }).toISO() }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9727aed6-4a13-48da-b16b-94eaf4ec582f",
      "name": "Next 26h appointments",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        220,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// event description must contain the customer's WhatsApp like: phone: 9198xxxxxxxx\nconst out = [];\nfor (const { json: e } of $input.all()) {\n  if (!e.start) continue;\n  const start = DateTime.fromISO(e.start.dateTime);\n  const h = start.diff($now, 'hours').hours;\n  const phone = (e.description || '').match(/phone:\\s*(\\d{10,13})/)?.[1];\n  if (!phone) continue;\n  const kind = (h > 23 && h <= 24) ? 'day-before' : (h > 1 && h <= 2) ? '2-hours' : null;\n  if (kind) out.push({ json: { eventId: e.id, name: (e.summary || '').split(/ [–-] /)[0].trim(), phone, kind, when: start.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('ccc d LLL, h:mm a') } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "1bdbc06a-d213-43a9-95a9-305d3a2f34ae",
      "name": "Due for reminder?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        -160
      ]
    },
